<title>USA: RPM Inc sells Craft House unit.</title>
<headline>RPM Inc sells Craft House unit.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>RPM Inc completed the sale of its Craft House Corp unit to Brynwood Partners III LP, an investment company, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Craft House is a producer of craft and hobby activities.</p>
<p>Chase Securities acted as RPM's financial advisor in the deal.</p>
